    title: 'How to Improve Your Credit Score: Practical Steps That Work',
    metaTitle: 'How to Improve Your Credit Score | Money Director',
    metaDescription: 'Learn practical, proven steps to improve your credit score, from paying on time to reducing utilization, disputing errors, and building a positive credit history.',
    slug: 'how-to-improve-credit-score',
    excerpt: 'A better credit score saves you thousands on loans and credit cards. This guide covers proven, practical steps to raise your score, from fixing errors to optimizing utilization.',
    featuredImage: 'https://images.pexels.com/photos/259200/pexels-photo-259200.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940',
