    metaTitle: 'How to Set Financial Goals You Will Achieve | Money Director',
    metaDescription: 'Learn how to set financial goals using the SMART framework, create an action plan, track progress, and stay motivated to reach your money goals.',
    slug: 'how-to-set-financial-goals',
    excerpt: 'Setting financial goals is easy, achieving them is hard. This guide shows you how to set goals using proven frameworks, create actionable plans, and actually follow through.',
    featuredImage: 'https://images.pexels.com/photos/5849577/pexels-photo-5849577.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&h=650&w=940',
    imageAlt: 'Wallet with money and income growth arrows on yellow background',
    authorId: 'sarah-chen',
    publishedDate: '2025-02-10', updatedDate: '2025-07-13', readingTime: 8,
